  "description": "EvoPdf Next Classic Compatibility Library for .NET lets an application written for the classic EvoPdf HTML to PDF Converter for .NET (the EvoPdf.HtmlToPdf package) run on the EvoPdf Next Library for .NET without code changes. The package keeps the classic EvoPdf namespace and its public types (HtmlToPdfConverter, Document, PdfPage, the elements, templates, forms, bookmarks and security settings) and renders with the Chromium-based engine of EvoPdf Next.\n\nReplace the classic package reference with this package and add the EvoPdf Next HTML to PDF package of the platform the application runs on: EvoPdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.Windows, EvoPdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.Linux, EvoPdf.Next.HtmlToPdf.MacOS or the multi-platform metapackage EvoPdf.Next.HtmlToPdf. The license key is set as before.\n\nThe converters hand over the EvoPdf Next converter before each conversion, for the options the classic API has no setting for, so the native API can be used alongside the classic one and the application can move to it gradually.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* .NET 10.0, 9.0, 8.0, 7.0, 6.0 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Windows, Linux and macOS\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications",
